1
00:00:00,887 --> 00:00:04,347
(Bernadette:)That's such good news, Howie.
Thank you for telling her.

2
00:00:04,524 --> 00:00:07,424
(Howard:)Hey, I'm a grown man.
I'm gonna live with my wife.

3
00:00:07,594 --> 00:00:11,794
(Howard:)My mother's just gonna have to learn
to make do on her own.

4
00:00:12,132 --> 00:00:13,622
(Bernadette:)Was she upset?

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,770
(Howard:)Who can tell? She yells everything.

6
00:00:19,139 --> 00:00:20,629
(Howard:)She might have been upset.

7
00:00:20,941 --> 00:00:22,531
(Howard:)She might have been hungry.

8
00:00:24,511 --> 00:00:27,311
(Bernadette:)Thanks for fixing it. I love you.

9
00:00:27,514 --> 00:00:30,544
(Howard:)I love you too. Sweet dreams.
I'll talk to you tomorrow.

10
00:00:30,951 --> 00:00:33,441
Goodnight, Rocket Man.

11
00:00:33,787 --> 00:00:37,387
(Howard:)To infinity and beyond, baby.

12
00:00:39,326 --> 00:00:44,726
(Dimitri:)Loops, you realize you just lied your ass off
to your wife and your mother.

13
00:00:44,965 --> 00:00:48,235
(Howard:)- I know.
- What are you gonna do when you get back?

14
00:00:48,735 --> 00:00:51,165
Oh, I'm never going back. Heh.

